      "content": "1.  839                                             HIGH STREET                                                 (North Side)                                                 No 120 SP 9907 NW 1/7 II 2. Late C18 or early C19.  Roughcast, hipped Welsh slate roof.  4 sash windows with glazing bars, 2 storeys.  6 fielded panel central door with oblong fanlight with glazing bars; surround of Doric pilasters, entablature with reeded frieze with paterae and sheafs, dentil cornice. Listing NGR: SP9940107731"
